{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "dsh-external/dsh-better-sidebar",
  "name": "dsh-better-sidebar",
  "displayName": "Better Sidebar",
  "summary": "更好用的右侧边栏工作台：文件树、编辑器、终端、Git、侧边对话、子代理都收在这一栏，会话之间互不干扰。",
  "summaryEn": "A dual workbench for DSH: native right sidebar plus self-drawn bottom panel, with the ctx.betterSidebar service open to every plugin.",
  "description": "开放的侧边栏底座，向三方插件暴露 ctx.betterSidebar 服务以便注册新侧边栏页面与文件预览器。内置文件渲染/编辑、终端、文件变动、任务、Git 面板与侧边对话，状态按会话存于 localStorage。单 npm 包，host 半身提供 /sidebar/api/* JSON API 与两条 WebSocket，client 半身渲染原生右栏与底部工作台。",
  "repo": "https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar",
  "homepage": null,
  "author": "omdsh-dev (Oh My DSH)",
  "category": [
    "sidebar",
    "ui",
    "developer-tools"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "sidebar",
    "editor",
    "terminal",
    "git",
    "side-chat",
    "extension-host",
    "zh",
    "en"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "language": "TypeScript",
  "version": "0.28.0",
